    - "GARY'S VAULT IS POPPING UP AGAIN IN APRIL!<br>Get ready for our next POP-UP estate sale coming soon to Portland's industrial east side. We will have a combination of estates present, including a couple larger estates too far to travel and personal treasures from Gary Germer's warehouse. So we're bringing them all together for one BIG smorgasbord of estate sales under one roof.<br>We will have tons of finds available in this warehouse estate sale. Great pieces of fine art, photography, and sculptures. Plenty of vintage furniture, home decor, and antique treasures. Antique toys, all kinds of collectibles and memorabilia, including authentic celebrity autographs. Lots of worldly pieces and sculptures. Plus, it wouldn't be an Easter estate sale without all the beautiful religious collectibles of Jesus, Mary, crucifixes, and adorable cherubs!"
